---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/ui/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { schemaScript, serviceSchema, webPageSchema } from '../lib/seo';

const path = '/bellini-bal-harbour-interior-design/';
const city = '/interior-designer-bal-harbour/';
const title = 'Bellini Bal Harbour Condo Interior Design | Paula Ambrosio';
const heading = 'Bellini Bal Harbour Condo Interior Design';
const description = 'Independent interior design for Bellini Bal Harbour condo owners. Plan a renovation, custom millwork or turnkey furnishing with our South Florida studio.';
const breadcrumbs = [{ name: 'Bal Harbour', url: city }, { name: heading, url: path }];
const scopes = [
  { title: 'Keep the layout. Change how it feels.', body: 'A furnishing refresh can change how the whole residence works without opening walls. We plan seating for conversation and the view, layer lighting, and select window treatments, rugs and fabrics with the coastal light in mind.' },
  { title: 'Renovate what no longer serves you.', body: 'When the kitchen, baths or closets no longer suit daily life, we evaluate what can stay and what needs a redesign. Our team designs finishes and built-in storage; independent contractors handle construction.' },
  { title: 'Bring the rooms together.', body: 'With a turnkey scope, the studio coordinates furnishings, purchasing, receiving, delivery and final styling, so decisions about finishes, millwork and furniture are made together.' },
];
---
<Layout {title} {description} canonical={path}>
  <Fragment slot="head" set:html={schemaScript(webPageSchema({ path, title, description, breadcrumbs }))} />
  <Fragment slot="head" set:html={schemaScript(serviceSchema({ path, name: heading, description, areaServed: ['Bal Harbour'] }))} />
  <article>
    <section class="border-b border-sand bg-linen py-16 lg:py-24">
      <div class="container-editorial">
        <Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbs} />
        <p class="eyebrow mt-10 text-stone">Existing condo renovations and furnishing</p>
        <h1 class="font-display mt-4 max-w-4xl text-display">{heading}</h1>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lede text-slate">A home at Bellini on Collins Avenue in Bal Harbour may already have the space you want. The question is what to keep and what to change. We help owners build on the best parts of their residence, from a furnishing refresh to a full interior renovation.</p>
        <a href="/contact/" class="btn-primary mt-8 inline-flex" data-analytics-event="cta_start_project" data-analytics-location="hero">Discuss Your Bellini Residence</a>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section aria-labelledby="scope-heading" class="container-editorial py-16 lg:py-24">
      <h2 id="scope-heading" class="font-display text-4xl">Choose the right scope for your condo</h2>
      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-3">
        {scopes.map(({ title, body }) => <div><h3 class="font-display text-2xl">{title}</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-slate">{body}</p></div>)}
      </div>
    </section>
    <section aria-labelledby="access-heading" class="border-t border-sand bg-bone py-16 lg:py-24">
      <div class="container-editorial grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow text-stone">Before the work starts</p>
          <h2 id="access-heading" class="font-display mt-4 text-4xl">Plan around the building and what is already there</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-4 leading-relaxed text-slate">
          <p>We start with a measured review after you authorize access. Before changing a kitchen or bath, we identify existing service locations and flag questions for your contractor and other qualified professionals. If a room is working well, we look for ways to keep useful fixtures, finishes or furniture.</p>
          <p>Before ordering or scheduling, we ask management about the current approval process, work hours, protection requirements, access and delivery routes. For an occupied residence, we also plan which rooms can remain in use while work moves through the home. Requirements and permits are confirmed with the association and authorities as applicable; approval is not assumed.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section aria-labelledby="studio-heading" class="container-editorial py-16 lg:py-24">
      <h2 id="studio-heading" class="font-display text-4xl">Plan the next chapter for your residence</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-slate">Explore our <a class="underline underline-offset-4" href="/turnkey-interior-design-miami/">turnkey interior design</a>, <a class="underline underline-offset-4" href="/millwork/">custom millwork</a> and <a class="underline underline-offset-4" href="/penthouse-interior-design-miami-beach/">penthouse interior design</a> services, or see how we work with owners across <a class="underline underline-offset-4" href={city}>Bal Harbour</a>.</p>
      <a href="/contact/" class="btn-primary mt-7 inline-flex" data-analytics-event="cta_start_project" data-analytics-location="footer">Start a Conversation</a>
      <p class="mt-8 max-w-3xl text-sm text-slate">Paula Ambrosio Interior Design is an independent interior design studio and is not affiliated with the developer, sales team or condominium association of this building. Building names are used for identification only.</p>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>
